<Base title="Our history">
  <PageHead title="Our history" lead="Klein Bots in 2011. VorTX since 2017." />
  <section class="section light"><div class="wrap prose">
    <p>Our journey began in 2011, when a group of like-minded students founded FRC Team 3735 as “Klein Bots.” Little did they know that their passion and dedication would drive the team to where we are today.</p>
    <p>Through 14 seasons (as of 2025) we have won 1 Impact Award, made 4 Worlds appearances, earned 10 judged awards and won 1 event. See every <a href="/robots/">robot</a> and <a href="/awards/">award</a>.</p>
  </div></section>
</Base>
